---
const nodes = [
  { city: "Valera", state: "Trujillo", type: "Hub Central Fibra Óptica", status: "Operativo 100%" },
  { city: "Jajó", state: "Trujillo", type: "Enlace Inalámbrico & FTTH", status: "Operativo 100%" },
  { city: "La Mesa de Esnujaque", state: "Trujillo", type: "Red Metropolitana", status: "Operativo 100%" },
  { city: "Cabimbú", state: "Trujillo", type: "Conectividad Rural & Urbana", status: "Operativo 100%" },
  { city: "Cuicas & La Cuchilla", state: "Trujillo", type: "Repetidor de Alta Potencia", status: "Operativo 100%" },
  { city: "Burbusay & Mesa de los Morenos", state: "Trujillo", type: "Enlaces Troncales", status: "Operativo 100%" },
];
---

<section id="cobertura" class="py-24 relative bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
      
      <!-- Left text -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-6">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 text-xs text-[#0A559F] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
          Infraestructura Trujillo
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
          Nuestra red llega donde <span class="text-gradient-ip">otros no llegan.</span>
        </h2>

        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
          Diseñamos y operamos una infraestructura híbrida de fibra óptica troncal y torres de microondas de alta capacidad para garantizar que los hogares, campos y empresas de Trujillo cuenten con internet ininterrumpido.
        </p>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 space-y-3">
          <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase text-slate-900 tracking-wider">¿Tu zona no aparece en la lista?</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
            Expandimos constantemente nuestros anillos de fibra y enlaces punto a punto. Consultá con nuestro equipo de ingeniería.
          </p>
          <a 
            href="https://wa.me/584260337589?text=Hola,%20deseo%20consultar%20cobertura%20en%20mi%20zona"
            target="_blank"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold text-[#FC0432] hover:text-[#DF0E0E] transition-colors pt-1"
          >
            <span>Consultar viabilidad técnica por WhatsApp</span>
            <span>→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right nodes grid -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          {nodes.map((node, index) => (
            <div class="coverage-card card-white p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 hover:border-[#FC0432]/40 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 group">
              <div class="flex items-start justify-between">
                <div>
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse"></span>
                    <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-[#FC0432] transition-colors">{node.city}</h3>
                  </div>
                  <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-500 block mt-0.5">{node.state}</span>
                </div>
                <span class="text-[10px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 border border-emerald-200 font-semibold">
                  {node.status}
                </span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 font-medium">
                {node.type}
              </p>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
